# docs/20 B1 regression (U3c, U6, U11; D7). Before: a G0 hold the lock swallowed left the
# card as it was, Mando dozing ("all is well") while nothing recorded; a recording that ended
# while locked left no trace on the card; the card said "to sync 0" (a third name for RN).
# Now: "Not recording" in bold where the clock was, Mando awake with "?"; how it ended ("√ Saved",
# "× Too short", why it stopped by itself), Mando sitting up or tilting his head; counts
# with one name each, "√ synced" once nothing waits on USB; the battery coloured when low.
boot store=sd usb=on bat=4100 lang=zh
include ../common/demo_state.cpas
wait 1500
press opt+l
shot locked  locked on USB: the card 2 s, Waiting 1 and √ synced
wait 2500
host sessions.snapshot {"rev":6,"total":2,"sessions":[{"sid":"8d3e7a19","slot":1,"name":"支付回调重试","kind":"tty","st":"waiting","need":true,"age_s":540},{"sid":"5c2e8a14","slot":2,"name":"cpa/host-sim","kind":"bg","st":"waiting","need":true,"age_s":75,"short":"a1b2c3"}]}
wait 300
shot needs-you  a second session waits: the card 3 s, Waiting 2 (counts only)
wait 3500
down g0
wait 900
shot not-recording  a swallowed hold: Not recording / Let go, tap, then hold; Mando awake, No rec
up g0
wait 3500
press g0
wait 300
down g0
wait 800
up g0
wait 1000
shot too-short  tap, then a 0.8 s hold: × Too short; Mando: Huh?
wait 3500
press opt+l
press enter
usb off
bat 3500
wait 3000
press opt+r
wait 600
press enter
mic 3000 2500
press opt+l
wait 2500
bat 3440
wait 12000
shot auto-stop  locked, the battery stopped the meeting: √ Saved / Meeting: low battery, Bat 16% red
wait 3000
shot dark  dark and locked again
